# Keyed-run template for the Workers deployed by hand (the landing's first upload, tools-redirect).
# The value lives in 1Password only: `env-exec request --template infra/cloudflare.env.example -- …`.
# Token scope: Account › Workers Scripts › Edit and Account › Account Settings › Read on this one
# account, no zone permission, a TTL of hours, IP-filtered to the host that runs it. The custom
# domain step of a cut-over needs zone permissions and gets its own token.
# op: import
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=op://Keyed-Runs/Cloudflare-Workers/CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN
